BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316085315@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T113000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Garret Mountain
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJoin me for the 5K paved loop at Garret Mountain
  Reservation.\nWe will meet at the parking lot on the loop\, turn right on
  Park Ave from Mountain Ave\, lot is on the left. GPS Address for Garrett 
 is 8 Mountain Ave Woodland Park.\n\nGarret Mountain Reservation\, located 
 in both Woodland Park and Paterson\, is one of Passaic County’s most fre
 quented parks. The original landscape was designed by the famed Olmsted Br
 others Firm. The 310 acres of recreational space sits more than 500 feet a
 bove sea level\, with scenic views of Paterson and the New York City skyli
 ne. Lambert Castle and Lambert Tower\, two of Passaic County’s historic 
 sites\, are also located within Garret Mountain Reservation.\n\nRain or ex
 treme weather will cancel the event.\n\nCollaborative walk with "Montclair
  Women Over 50."\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please underst
 and that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being and 
 will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316085315/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T142603Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T142603Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316036636@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T110000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Rahway River Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n**This walk begins at 9:30 AM**\nPlease plan to 
 arrive 5 minutes early. The walk will start promptly.\n\nWe'll do the peri
 meter loop and the lake loop\, together they are about 2 miles.\nThe group
  will do 2 circuits (4 miles) in 90 minutes\, but all are welcome to stop 
 after one (or stay longer😁). The path is 100% paved.\n**Wear comfortabl
 e shoes and don't forget your water.**\n\n[Perimeter Loop](https://www.all
 trails.com/trail/us/new-jersey/rahway-river-perimeter-loop?u=i&sh=vgtzxk)\
 n[Lake Loop](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/new-jersey/lake-rahway-loo
 p?u=i&sh=vgtzxk)\n\nMeet near the Ulrich pool house. There are parking lot
 s on both sides of Parkway Drive and street parking nearby.\n\nDisclaimer:
  If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible fo
 r your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in
  case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316036636/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260808T213451Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260808T213451Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_315136614@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260904T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260904T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/315136614/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260606T190133Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260606T190133Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316039129@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T110000
SUMMARY:🚶Yanticaw Park Nutley
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nMeet along Park Drive in Nutley near the Orechio
  Sports Complex. We'll walk about 3.5 mile through scenic Yanticaw Park\, 
 up to Kingsland St. and back. The path is paved and mostly flat.\n\nPlease
  check the event page beforehand in case of any changes. Inclement weather
  will cancel the walk.\n\nThe Yanticaw Park is an Essex County-owned park 
 in Nutley\, New Jersey. It is located between Centre Street and Chestnut S
 treet\, extending west to Passaic Avenue.\n\nEssex County began purchasing
  land in 1911 for creation of the park. Wetlands in the park were drained\
 , and a dam was set up to form a lake. The park was completed in 1914. In 
 1962\, the lake\, containing a small island was drained and a channel was 
 dug as a continuation of the natural third river from the south.\n\nPLEASE
  ARRIVE 5 MINUTES **EARLY** SO WE CAN START TO WALK ON TIME\n\nDisclaimer:
  If you join us for a walk/hike\, please understand that you are responsib
 le for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liab
 le in case of injury or mishap. Walk/hike will be canceled in the event of
  extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316039129/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260809T013220Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T013220Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
